      <Xref identifier="Q9LLH9" dataSource="uniprot" />
      <Graphics centerX="150" centerY="495" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">|FRAME: TAX-3702 &lt;i&gt;Arabidopsis thaliana&lt;/i&gt;| has six acyl-CoA oxidase (ACX) genes. &lt;i&gt;In vitro&lt;/i&gt; enzyme assays have determined substrate specificities for |FRAME: AT4G16760 ACX1| (long chain), |FRAME: AT5G65110 ACX2| (very-long chain), |FRAME: AT1G06290 ACX3| (medium chain) and |FRAME: AT3G51840 ACX4| (short chain). &lt;i&gt;In vivo&lt;/i&gt; studies of enzyme activities using each ACX mutants confirmed &lt;i&gt;in vitro&lt;/i&gt; results |CITS: [15743450]|.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="AT1G06290-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Araport" value="AT1G06290.1" />
