  <Groups>
    <Group elementId="CPLX-7063" textLabel="very-log-chain acyl-CoA oxidase" type="Complex">
      <Xref identifier="CPLX-7063" dataSource="plantcyc" />
      <Graphics centerX="150" centerY="335" width="140" height="100" textColor="666666" fontName="Arial" fontSize="10" borderColor="9900CC" borderStyle="Dashed" borderWidth="2.0" fillColor="F5E6FF" shapeType="Rectangle" zOrder="-1" />
      <Comment>|FRAME: TAX-3702| has six acyl-CoA oxidase (ACX) genes. &lt;i&gt;In vitro&lt;/i&gt; enzyme assays have determined substrate specificities for |FRAME: AT4G16760| (long chain), |FRAME: AT5G65110| (very-long chain), |FRAME: AT1G06290| (medium chain) and |FRAME: AT3G51840| (short chain). &lt;i&gt;In vivo&lt;/i&gt; studies of enzyme activities using each ACX mutants confirmed &lt;i&gt;in vitro&lt;/i&gt; results |CITS: [15743450]|.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="CPLX-7063" />
      <Property key="ComplexComponents" value="AT5G65110-MONOMER" />
